+        {# [isambard3] ADDED: re-activate the built environment for EVERY task. Cylc runs
+           each job under a login shell (`bash -l`), which resets Lmod to the system
+           defaults and PURGES the lfric-env module the scheduler had loaded -- so the
+           view's bin/ is dropped and the job dies with `rose: command not found`
